form. It doesn't hurt to eat amulets of magical breating
while you are doing this. Spells of polymorph and
cancellation rock. Remember that you can dip the
objects into potions of restore ability, it you want to
save them to later use. A good way to acquire potions
of restore ability is to polymorph potions... :)
